## Decoder validation

This chunk modifies no production code paths. The W44-75 dump infrastructure
is gated by `JXL_W44_75_DUMP_CTXMAP` env var (only writes files when set);
the encoder bitstream is byte-identical with env unset. W44-71 patch is also
kept WIP-only (NOT default).

